    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then the number of elements in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> is:"
  },
