  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>Now, let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>±</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now, taking <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> we get, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>And equating <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> we get, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the number of elements in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
  }
